
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Q as Quality Engine
    participant API as Incident API
    participant S as Supervisor
    participant R as Agent Router
    participant T as Specialist Agents
    participant E as Evidence Verifier
    participant X as Sandbox
    participant H as Human Analyst

    Q->>API: Quality alert
    API->>S: Open investigation
    S->>R: Classify and route
    R->>T: Activate selected specialists
    T-->>S: Structured observations
    S->>E: Verify evidence
    alt Evidence insufficient
        E-->>S: Missing evidence
        S->>R: Replan investigation
        R->>T: Additional safe probes
        T-->>S: New observations
        S->>E: Revalidate
    end
    E-->>S: Supported findings
    S->>X: Validate remediation proposal
    X-->>S: Test report
    S->>H: Request review
    H-->>API: Approve or reject
    API-->>H: Store decision and audit
